== Notes ==
* ''Darkvision'' does not have the same effect as [[ultravision]]; it does not allow sight in magical [[darkness]]. ''Ultravision'' is needed to see within magical [[darkness]].
* This ability negates the +5 increase to [[spot]] [[difficulty class|DCs]] at night, even if the spotter does not have a source of light.
* When the brightness of the area lowering to 15 or below (after dusk), then activated a dynamic glow VFX for this creature, hinting that this is a works the Darkvision. Or also if set the Brightness on 15- in Moon Diffuse Color in area visual properties.

